WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.050
Hello, everyone. Here I am at my new job!

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:19.950
Yesterday at my first day of work … Well, let’s not talk about yesterday.

3
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.990
Today is a new day!

4
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.250
Today I want to apologize to my co-workers.

5
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.690
Hi, Anne. Are you busy?

6
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:33.370
Hi, Anna. Yes. At 10 a.m. I am writing.

7
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.690
Every day I do my morning show.

8
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.050
Sorry!

9
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:42.530
Okay. See you later, maybe.

10
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.110
Maybe I’ll see you later.

11
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.170
Hi, Jonathan. Are you busy?

12
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:49.810
Yes, I’m busy.

13
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.410
When the studio light is on, I am recording my evening show.

14
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.750
Right. Sorry about yesterday.

15
00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:57.970
No worries.

16
00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.570
May I see the studio?

17
00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.950
Um, maybe another time?

18
00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.990
Right now I am busy.

19
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.350
Sure. Okay, ’bye.

20
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.110
‘Bye.

21
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.310
Hi, Amelia! Are you busy?

22
00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:19.710
I’m a little busy.

23
00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:24.210
I want to say I’m sorry for yesterday.

24
00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:25.710
It’s okay, Anna.

25
00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.370
Well, I am sorry.

26
00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:30.190
It’s okay, Anna. Come by this afternoon.

27
00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.410
Okay.
